## Round r1 report — A2_fx_carry

**Bottom line: 0 of 11 idea-variants passed all gates. No sleeves saved. FINDINGS.md ends with `ROUND r1 DONE`.**

### Data reality that shaped everything
- `data/fx` (twelvedata) starts **2019-04**, not 2007 → the charter's "18.5y window" isn't achievable with that panel
- Free long history: FRED daily spots EUR/GBP/JPY/CAD **2000+** (4 pairs, 20y); foreign 10y yields are **monthly, 2018+** only
- So carry = 7 pairs from 2018-07; momentum/reversal = 4 pairs from 2000+

### What was tried (all: T+1, 6bps/side, trailing-only 10% vol target, full gate battery)

