| 11. Blend of 10+252d-tsmom+6m-ratemom | equal-wt | **0.38** | 0.48/0.32 | FAIL SR + yearly (8 neg yrs); scramble p<0.001 PASS; pairwise ρ≈0.03 |

### Honesty notes
- Caught and fixed a 100× units bug in idea 10 (FRED yields are in percent) before it could fool anyone — pre-fix it printed SR 25; post-fix SR 0.30
- Rejected the "accrual-only" book (SR 27, vol 0.1%) as a **deterministic data artifact**, not a tradable strategy
- Also fixed two silent pandas alignment bugs (`.div(axis=0)`, monthly-resample before `.diff()`) that had produced all-zero backtests
- Key economic finding: **spot-only carry measures nothing — accrual is the strategy**; with accrual, carry is weakly positive but the 2018+ window contains no true carry-crash stress test

### Recommendation to coordinator
FX on free data cannot clear SR 0.6 alone. The idea-11 blend is a legitimate *diversifier* (uncorrelated, scramble-real, H2-robust) only if the coordinator relaxes the bar to ~0.4 — flagged, not saved. A proper carry test needs policy-rate/CPI data beyond what's on disk.

~35 tool calls used, all scripts preserved under `campaign/agents/A2_fx_carry/scripts/` for r2 iteration.
